<title>UK: AMEX unit sets $400 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>AMEX unit sets $400 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AMERICAN EXPRESS CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $400 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    01.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.782    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A1	  REOFFER    99.782</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
